h of $y=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x.$" 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111369 1068 #edb/ref 17592186109909 13194139533425 17592186045585 false] [17592186111369 1068 #edb/ref 17592186335544 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111369 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111369 1071 "Which of the following values is in the domain of $y = \\arccos x$?" 13194139533425 17592186045585 false] [17592186111369 1071 "Which of the following values is in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x?$" 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111369 1074 "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/9d/9dcc5a116c2a564547283783a7df7b1cd3a9ab3b76ac24dc2695c4cb367796d5.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The domain of the function is $[-1,1].$\n\nTherefore, of the given values, only $x=\\frac{1}{5}$ is in the domain of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$" 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111370 1068 #edb/ref 17592186109915 13194139533425 17592186045585 false] [17592186111370 1068 #edb/ref 17592186335680 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111370 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111370 1071 "Which of the following values is in the range of $y = \\arccos x$?" 13194139533425 17592186045585 false] [17592186111370 1071 "Which of the following values is in the range of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x?$" 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111370 1074 "Let's recall the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arccos}⁡x.$\n\n![](images/9d/9dcc5a116c2a564547283783a7df7b1cd3a9ab3b76ac24dc2695c4cb367796d5.png)\n\nNote that:\n\n- The range of the function is $[0,\\pi ].$\n\nTherefore, of the given values, only $\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ is in the range of the function." 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111374 1068 #edb/ref 17592186109939 13194139533425 17592186045585 false] [17592186111374 1068 #edb/ref 17592186335683 13194139533425 17592186045585 true] [17592186111374 1070 #